<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SIC EDGAR USL Explorer</title>
<style>
/* Zetaris light theme. The --z-* values are the tokens published on zetaris.com; the semantic names below point at them, so a dark theme is a token override. Small text uses darker derived shades (--orange, --good, --cyan-text) because the brand amber, green and cyan fail contrast on white. */
@font-face { font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans"; src: url("assets/fonts/plus-jakarta-sans.ttf") format("truetype"); font-style: normal; font-weight: 200 800; font-display: swap; }
:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --z-white: #ffffff; --z-obsidian: #06070d; --z-ink-3: #15171f; --z-ink-2: #2a2d39;
  --z-text-3: #595e6e; --z-border: #e7e7ee; --z-border-firm: #d5d5e0;
  --z-indigo: #4052f2; --z-indigo-deep: #2f3ec2; --z-indigo-soft: #7c89f7; --z-indigo-mist: #dbe0fd; --z-indigo-tint: #f3f5fe;
  --z-glow: rgba(64, 82, 242, 0.15);
  --z-cyan: #27a7d2; --z-success: #15c46b; --z-warning: #f0a020; --z-danger: #ef4444;
  --z-radius-sm: 8px; --z-radius-md: 12px; --z-radius-lg: 20px;
  --font-sans: "Plus Jakarta Sans", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  --font-mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;

  --bg: var(--z-white);
  --surface: var(--z-indigo-tint);
  --surface-2: var(--z-indigo-mist);
  --line: var(--z-border);
  --line-firm: var(--z-border-firm);
  --fg: var(--z-obsidian);
  --head: var(--z-obsidian);
  --muted: var(--z-text-3);
  --accent: var(--z-indigo);
  --accent-hover: var(--z-indigo-deep);
  --accent-tint: var(--z-indigo-mist);
  --cyan: var(--z-cyan);
  --cyan-text: #146e8e;
  --cyan-tint: #e4f5fb;
  --orange: #a35700;
  --orange-tint: #fff3dc;
  --good: #0b7a43;
  --good-tint: #e2f8ec;
  --bad: #b42318;
  --bad-tint: #fee4e2;
  --ent-head: var(--z-ink-3);
  --ent-sub: #9aa0b0;
  --code-bg: var(--z-ink-3);
  --code-fg: #e7eaf1;
  --code-muted: #8b93a7;
  --code-pass: #15c46b;
  --code-info: #27a7d2;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font: 400 16px/1.55 var(--font-sans); }
h1, h2, h3, h4, p { margin: 0; }
h1, h2, h3, h4 { text-wrap: balance; color: var(--head); }
code, .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.88em; }
.num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
a { color: var(--accent); }
a:hover { color: var(--accent-hover); }

/* masthead: white page, the Zetaris logo, an eyebrow, the title and a segmented tab control */
.mast { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: var(--bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 28px 16px 0; }
.mast::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(60% 140% at 100% 0%, var(--z-glow), transparent 62%); pointer-events: none; }
.mast-in { position: relative; max-width: 1180px; margin-inline: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; padding-bottom: 24px; }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.zlogo { display: block; height: 34px; width: auto; }
.partner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding-left: 18px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line-firm); }
.partner img { display: block; max-height: 30px; max-width: 180px; width: auto; height: auto; }
.eyebrow { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); }
.mast h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
.mast p { max-width: 74ch; color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }
.tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; padding: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); background: var(--surface); }
.tab { font: 600 15px/1 var(--font-sans); color: var(--muted); background: transparent; border: 0; border-radius: var(--z-radius-sm); padding: 14px 20px; min-height: 44px; cursor: pointer; }
.tab:hover { color: var(--head); }
.tab[aria-selected="true"] { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
.tab:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }

main { max-width: 1180px; margin-inline: auto; padding-block: 40px 80px; padding-inline: 16px; }
.panel { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 52px; }
section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; min-width: 0; }
.sec-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
h3 { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.lede { color: var(--muted); max-width: 74ch; }

/* stat strip */
.stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); background: var(--surface); overflow: hidden; }
.stat { padding: 18px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
.stat + .stat { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
.stat b { font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--head); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.stat span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; }
.stat.warn b { color: var(--orange); }
@media (max-width: 640px) { .stat + .stat { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } }

/* cards */
.cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 360px), 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.card { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 var(--accent); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); padding: 22px 20px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; min-width: 0; }
.card-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.card h3 { font: 500 20px/1.2 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--head); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.rows { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1; color: var(--head); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.rows small { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--muted); margin-left: 6px; }
.card p { color: var(--muted); }
dl { margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7.6rem minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 8px 14px; font-size: 14.5px; }
dt { color: var(--muted); }
dd { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

/* bars */
.bars { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.bar-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 17rem minmax(0, 1fr) 3.2rem; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
.bar-label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; line-height: 1.3; }
.bar-label b { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; }
.bar-label i { font-style: normal; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
.bar-track { height: 14px; background: var(--surface); border-radius: 999px; min-width: 0; }
.bar-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--line-firm); border-radius: 999px; }
.bar-row.hit .bar-fill { background: var(--accent); }
.bar-row.hit .bar-label i { color: var(--fg); }
.bar-val { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 700; }
.key { display: flex; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
.key span::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; margin-right: 6px; vertical-align: -1px; background: var(--line-firm); border-radius: 999px; }
.key span.hit::before { background: var(--accent); }
.key span.note::before { display: none; }
@media (max-width: 640px) { .bar-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 3.2rem; } .bar-label { grid-column: 1 / -1; } }

/* tables */
.tbl-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14.5px; }
th { text-align: left; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; padding: 12px 14px; background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
td { padding: 12px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
td.r, th.r { text-align: right; }
.pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
.pill::before { content: ""; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; }
.pill.good { color: var(--good); background: var(--good-tint); }
.pill.info { color: var(--cyan-text); background: var(--cyan-tint); }
.pill.warn { color: var(--orange); background: var(--orange-tint); }

.two { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 420px), 1fr)); gap: 32px; align-items: start; }
.finds { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; }
.finds li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.finds li:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
.finds b { font-weight: 700; color: var(--head); }
.finds span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14.5px; }

/* diagrams */
.diagram { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); background: var(--bg); }
.diagram svg { display: block; min-width: 1000px; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.cap { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; max-width: 84ch; }
svg text { font-family: var(--font-sans); fill: var(--fg); }
svg .colh { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; fill: var(--muted); }
svg .lane { fill: var(--surface); }
svg .lane-t { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; fill: var(--muted); }
svg .box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--z-ink-2); stroke-width: 1.5; rx: 8px; }
svg .box.ext { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke: var(--muted); }
svg .box.usl { stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 2.5; }
svg .box.store { stroke: var(--cyan); stroke-width: 2.5; }
svg .bt { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--head); }
svg .bs { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }
svg .bm { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; }
svg .bar-usl, svg .bar-store { display: none; }
svg .flow { stroke: var(--z-ink-2); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
svg .flow.store { stroke: var(--cyan); stroke-width: 2.2; }
svg .flow-lbl { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
svg .fk-line { stroke: var(--orange); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
svg .fk-lbl { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--orange); }
svg .also { fill: none; stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; rx: 8px; }
svg .ent { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--z-ink-2); stroke-width: 1.5; }
svg .ent-h { fill: var(--ent-head); }
svg .ent-ht { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; fill: #fff; }
svg .ent-hs { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--ent-sub); }
svg .row-sep { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; }
svg .cn { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; }
svg .ct { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; fill: var(--muted); }
svg .badge { fill: var(--surface-2); }
svg .badge.fk { fill: var(--orange-tint); }
svg .bd { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--head); }
svg .bd.fk { fill: var(--orange); }
svg .row-hl { fill: var(--orange-tint); }
svg .callout { fill: var(--surface); }
svg .callout-t { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--head); }
svg .callout-s { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--muted); }
svg .callout-bar { fill: var(--orange); }

/* proof tab */
.verdict { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px 28px; align-items: center; background: var(--good-tint); border: 1px solid #b9ebd0; border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); padding: 18px 20px; }
.verdict .big { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--good); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.verdict .meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 22px; color: var(--fg); font-size: 14px; }
.verdict .meta b { font-weight: 700; }
.chain { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.stages { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.stg { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 var(--z-success); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); padding: 16px 14px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
.stg.info { box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 var(--cyan); }
.stg .k { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
.stg .t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--head); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.stg .n { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--head); line-height: 1.1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.stg .s { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
.checks { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 340px), 1fr)); gap: 8px 24px; }
.checks li { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14.5px; min-width: 0; }
.checks li::before { content: "PASS"; flex: none; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--good); background: var(--good-tint); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 8px; }
.checks li span { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
details { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); background: var(--surface); }
summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--head); }
details > .code { margin: 0 12px 12px; }

.code { position: relative; background: var(--code-bg); color: var(--code-fg); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); }
.code pre { margin: 0; padding: 14px 16px; padding-right: 84px; overflow-x: auto; font: 400 13px/1.55 var(--font-mono); tab-size: 2; }
.code.out pre { padding-right: 16px; color: #c9cfdd; }
.code .lbl { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--code-muted); padding: 6px 14px; }
.code.out { border-left: 4px solid var(--z-indigo-soft); }
.code.out pre, .code.has-lbl pre { padding-top: 28px; }
.copy { position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; font: 700 12px/1 var(--font-sans); color: #fff; background: var(--accent); border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; cursor: pointer; }
.copy:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }
.copy:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--z-indigo-soft); outline-offset: 2px; }
.copy.done { background: var(--good); }
.pass { color: var(--code-pass); } .okc { color: var(--code-info); } .dim { color: var(--code-muted); }

.steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px; counter-reset: step; padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; }
.step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 4px 16px; counter-increment: step; }
.step::before { content: counter(step); grid-row: 1 / span 2; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.step > h3 { align-self: center; }
.step .body { grid-column: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-width: 0; }
.step p, .step li { color: var(--fg); }
.step ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.callout-box { border-left: 4px solid var(--orange); background: var(--orange-tint); border-radius: var(--z-radius-sm); padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 14.5px; }
.callout-box.info { border-left-color: var(--cyan); background: var(--cyan-tint); }
.callout-box b { color: var(--head); }
.disclaimer { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 16px; max-width: 90ch; }
@media (max-width: 560px) { .step { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .step::before { grid-row: auto; } .step .body { grid-column: 1; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .panel { animation: fade 0.18s ease-out; } @keyframes fade { from { opacity: 0.4; } to { opacity: 1; } } }

/* live SQL tab */
.live-status { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 16px; }
.dot { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--muted); }
.dot::before { content: ""; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; }
.dot.on { background: var(--good-tint); color: var(--good); }
.dot.off { background: var(--orange-tint); color: var(--orange); }
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.chip { font: 600 13px/1 var(--font-sans); color: var(--head); background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line-firm); border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 14px; cursor: pointer; }
.chip:hover { background: var(--accent-tint); border-color: var(--accent); }
.chip:focus-visible, .btn:focus-visible, .sqlbox:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
.sqlbox { width: 100%; min-height: 150px; resize: vertical; background: var(--code-bg); color: var(--code-fg); border: 0; border-left: 4px solid var(--z-indigo-soft); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); padding: 14px 16px; font: 400 14px/1.55 var(--font-mono); tab-size: 2; }
.actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 14px; }
.btn { font: 700 14px/1 var(--font-sans); color: #fff; background: var(--accent); border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 14px 24px; cursor: pointer; }
.btn:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }
.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.55; cursor: progress; }
.btn.alt { background: var(--bg); color: var(--head); border: 1px solid var(--line-firm); }
.btn.alt:hover { background: var(--surface); }
.hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
.res-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 18px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
.res-meta b { color: var(--head); font-weight: 700; }
.res-wrap { max-height: 480px; overflow: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--z-radius-md); }
.res-wrap table { font-size: 13.5px; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; }
.res-wrap th { position: sticky; top: 0; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--head); z-index: 1; }
.res-wrap td { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12.5px; white-space: nowrap; max-width: 520px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.res-wrap td.nul { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }
.res-wrap td.rn, .res-wrap th.rn { color: var(--muted); text-align: right; width: 1%; }

/* conformance report (loaded from a file in this browser) */
.verdict.bad { background: var(--bad-tint); border-color: #f5b5ae; }
.verdict.bad .big { color: var(--bad); }
.pill.bad { color: var(--bad); background: var(--bad-tint); }
.pill.skip { color: var(--muted); background: var(--surface-2); }
.rep-note { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }
.rep-opt { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; margin-left: 6px; }
#reportView { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
#reportView details table { font-size: 13.5px; }
#reportView ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="mast">
  <div class="mast-in">
    <div class="brand">
      <img class="zlogo" src="assets/brand/zetaris-indigo.svg" alt="Zetaris" width="123" height="34">
      <!--partner-logo-->
    </div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Zetaris Unified Semantic Layer on {{STORE_NAME}}</div>
    <h1>sic_edgar_usl</h1>
    <p>Seven EDGAR companies tied to the 1,005-code SIC hierarchy through one foreign key, then materialized to an S3-compatible object store and checked from the source API to the Parquet file.</p>
    <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Views">
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-analysis" aria-controls="panel-analysis" aria-selected="true">USL analysis</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-topology" aria-controls="panel-topology" aria-selected="false">Topology and ERD</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-proof" aria-controls="panel-proof" aria-selected="false">Proof and recipe</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-live" aria-controls="panel-live" aria-selected="false">Live SQL</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<!-- ============================ TAB 1 ============================ -->
<div class="panel" id="panel-analysis" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-analysis">

  <section aria-label="Summary">
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><b>2</b><span>tables in the USL</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>1,012</b><span>rows in total</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>12</b><span>columns in total</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>3</b><span>key constraints: 2 primary, 1 foreign</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>2</b><span>tables materialized to object storage</span></div>
      <div class="stat warn"><b>1</b><span>row fails a check: IBM, SIC 3570</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="h-tables">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="h-tables">The two tables</h2>
      <p class="lede">Both are activated from REST sources, so the data stays at the source and the USL holds the model, keys and checks. Each has also been written once as Parquet to the object store.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-top"><h3>sic_code</h3><div class="rows">1,005<small>rows</small></div></div>
        <p>The SIC hierarchy: one row for each four-digit industry code, with its division, major group and industry group.</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>Columns</dt><dd>8, from <code>sic_code</code> to <code>industry_group_desc</code></dd>
          <dt>Primary key</dt><dd><code>sic_code</code>, 1,005 of 1,005 valid</dd>
          <dt>Shape</dt><dd>10 divisions, 83 major groups, 416 industry groups</dd>
          <dt>Source</dt><dd><code>company_dns.sic_codes_raw</code> (API V3), unpacked with <code>explode</code> over the <code>data.sics</code> map. The V4 API returns the same 1,005 codes.</dd>
          <dt>Object store</dt><dd><code>&lt;your folder&gt;/usl_demo/sic_edgar_usl/sic_code/</code>: 1 Parquet file, 42,039 bytes, 1,005 rows</dd>
        </dl>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-top"><h3>company</h3><div class="rows">7<small>rows</small></div></div>
        <p>One row for each company: its CIK, name, SIC code and the industry wording EDGAR uses.</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>Columns</dt><dd>4: <code>cik</code>, <code>entity_name</code>, <code>sic</code>, <code>sic_description_edgar</code></dd>
          <dt>Primary key</dt><dd><code>cik</code>, 7 of 7 valid</dd>
          <dt>Foreign key</dt><dd><code>sic</code> references <code>sic_code.sic_code</code>, 6 of 7 valid</dd>
          <dt>Source</dt><dd><code>UNION ALL</code> of seven <code>sec_data.*_submissions_raw</code> tables; empty values become blank strings</dd>
          <dt>Object store</dt><dd><code>&lt;your folder&gt;/usl_demo/sic_edgar_usl/company/</code>: 7 Parquet files of one row each, 10,660 bytes, 7 rows</dd>
        </dl>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="h-div">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="h-div">Where the SIC codes sit</h2>
      <p class="lede">Codes in <code>sic_code</code> by division. Manufacturing holds almost half of them, and three of the seven companies sit there.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bars" role="list">
      <div class="bar-row" role="listitem"><div class="bar-label"><b>A Agriculture, forestry, fishing</b></div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:12.6%"></div></div><div class="bar-val">58</div></div>
