  <section aria-labelledby="h-phys">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="h-phys">Physical topology</h2>
      <p class="lede">What runs where, and which protocol each link uses. Credentials for the object store stay on the workstation and travel inside the materialize statement.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="diagram">
